window.products.push({"id":182075,"name":"10pcs Tissue Hanging Paper Pom-poms Flower Ball Wedding Party Outdoor Decoration, Hmxpls Premium Tissue Paper Pom Pom Flowers Craft Kit(Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tx-0mBrAL._AC_SL1025_.jpg","description":"Main Features: The main features of these pom poms set include: - 10pcs poms poms in sizes 10 inches - Hand made using premium paper. - Each pom pom comes with white ribbon and instructions - Pre-cut pieces for easy folding each sheet and fluff into shape to create beautiful and realistic paper flower pom-poms. - Lightweight and easy to hang them from the ceiling, above a table, under the verandah, or from branches in trees. - Perfect for any occasion: Birthday, Wedding, Christening Baby shower, Kitchen tea, Nursery decorations or any other celebration. How to DIY paper flower? 1, Unfold the party ball, fanning out the tissue paper. Ensure the ribbon is centered along the length of paper. 2, Pull on each point of paper at one end of tissue, fluffing each point to the centre of the ball. When all points have been fluffed, this should form half a sphere. 3, Hold party ball by ribbon so as the fluffed part of ball is upside down and start to fluff all points of the other half of the ball. once this step is finished you will have a full arty ball and you can hanging this where you like by the ribbon.  These easy DIY paper flower pom-poms bring your paper flower décor from floor to ceiling. Use in lieu of balloons, for an earth-friendly, lightweight, hassle-free party decoration. They look great for a unique party decoration.Create an instant festive atmosphere to your party with these gorgeous pom poms!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tx-0mBrAL._AC_SL1025_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hmxpls","source_asin":"B01DZPL30M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DZPL30M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DZPL30M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
