window.products.push({"id":182119,"name":"MOSO NATURAL Air Purifying Bag 200g. A Scent Free Odor Eliminator for Cars, Closets, Bathrooms, Pet Areas. Premium Moso Bamboo Charcoal Odor Absorber.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7101Gg2El-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eliminate the Odor in your Household The Moso Natural Air Purifying Bags are an easy and convenient way to maintain fresh, dry and odorless environment. Made of just one incredibly powerful, natural ingredient, moso bamboo charcoal, the Moso Bag is continuously working to effectively absorb and remove odors, and harmful pollutants and to clean and freshen the air. The bamboo charcoal neutralizes even scents and stubborn smells, such as those caused by humidity, pet urine, cat litterboxes, wet dogs, cigarette smoke, harmful particles and more. The Moso Natural odor absorber is also excellent for use in damp environments, where it will absorb excess moisture. Finally, an air cleaner that is good for people and tough on bad smells while it automatically freshens and cleans the air. The Moso Bag is a natural, alternative to chemical deodorizers, candles, gels, sprays and crystals that are not healthy for people and not good for the planet. The natural activated bamboo charcoal freshener is sealed inside a beautifully stitched linen bag that can be placed on any surface. Simply place the Moso Bag inside the affected area and leave them in overnight. To reactivate, place the bag outside in the sun once a month for at least one hour. With proper care, the Moso Bags will last up to two years and at the end of the bags lifespan you can recycle the bamboo charcoal into the soil. The bag is easily portable and can be conveniently moved from closet to bathroom to basement or bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7101Gg2El-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOSO NATURAL","source_asin":"B085Z7JBJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085Z7JBJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085Z7JBJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
