window.products.push({"id":182226,"name":"YEMYHOM Ottoman Cover Latest Jacquard Design High Stretch Folding Storage Footstool Protector Rectangle Removable Slipcover (Ottoman Small, Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+cPeDNCFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fabric and Pattern: YEMYHOM Ottoman Slipcover is crafted from 85% Polyester and 15% Spandex jacquard material, soft and skin-friendly to touch, breathable and comfortable when you sit on, durable and wear-resistant during your usage. The high quality covers for footrest and footstool is designed with 0.6 by 0.6 inches upgraded large checks that would be an eye catching for your guests in your home Perfect Fit：This ottoman protector is elastic enough to fit most ottomans and foot rest. Small, medium, large, oversized, square or rectangular type. Small Size is suiable for 28\"-34\" length, 18\"-25\" width, 14\"-20\" height. Large Size is suiable for 35\"-45\" length, 23\"-33\" width, 14\"-20\" height. Extra Large Size is suiable for 46\"-56\" length, 23\"-33\" width, 14\"-20\" height. Please measure your ottoman before purchase. Full Protection: The super stretchable bands at the ottoman bottom provides the all round coverage and skid resistance, preventing daily stains, scuffs and naughty kids, as well as cat scratch, dog bites and furs if you have an energetic pet in your home. With this premium ottoman cover, no worries for you, as it will not only be functional to protect your old furniture, but also add sophistication & elegance to your home decor. Easy Installation & Clean: Strapless design makes the fitted ottoman slip cover relaxing to cover the ottoman from one bottom end to the other bottom end, wrinkle-free and no need help from others. Specific Installation Guide of the universal footstool slipcovers is displayed in the listing. WASH TIPS: machine washable, separately in cold water on the gentle cycle, no bleaching, no ironing 100% Support: We are proud of the quality of our magical stylish footstool protector and we know you'll love it. This is why we back it with 100% Money Back Guarantee, to help you buy with confidence. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We are always here and glad to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+cPeDNCFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEMYHOM","source_asin":"B08NY4JG6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NY4JG6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NY4JG6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":182227,"name":"bloomair Woven Rattan Electric Wax Melt Warmer, Metal Wax Warmer for Scented Wax, Rustic Wax Melter Oil Burner, Candle Warmer with 25W Edison Bulb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mJ4XAJIBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Rustic Woven Rattan Electric Metal Wax Melt Warmer 】- Bloomair electric wax warmer is sturdy and fancy all in one package. Gives a very antique feel of warmth in its little spot. It is a perfect way to bring scents into your home without an open flame. Each wax warmer is outfitted with a 25W bulb that heats a melting dish to steadily release fragrance into the air. Just turn it on, enjoy a fancy visual experience and the aroma for hours! 【Warm Glow of 25W Edison Bulb 】- The light gives the perfect ambience and the heat is definitely sufficient to melt wax quickly without flame, soot, or other pollutants. Simply add wax melts to the dish, turn it on, and enjoy your favorite fragrance as it spreads through the room. It has that rustic lantern look, fits the decor (farmhouse) of your home quite nicely, and visually appears to be of great quality. 【 Easy to Use and Clean 】- This wax burner is easy-to-clean and switch out fragrances! Place a 1-2 wax melt cubes into a clean warmer dish, warmer will melt the wax cubes releasing fragrance into the air. When you are done, allow wax to cool and harden for easy removal. The top dish is removable as well as the lid on top where the wax goes, for easy cleaning. 【 Flameless Alternative to Candles 】- Fragrance the home safely with Bloomair wax warmer for scented wax. Electric wax warmer are a safer and cleaner alternative to burning traditional candles. Simply warm your own scented wax melts in the warmer dish to fill your room with fragrance. Smokeless, flameless, and easy to use. 【 Top Quality & Excellent Guarantee 】- Bloomair Electric Wax Warmer offers 90-day free returns and a one-year warranty. If you have any problems with your purchase, we will provide you a satisfactory solution. This wax warmer is a prefect gift choice for your family members, friends, all your loves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mJ4XAJIBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bloomair","source_asin":"B09CTWZMNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CTWZMNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CTWZMNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
