window.products.push({"id":182247,"name":"cuokiz Lumbar Support Pillow for Office Chair Back, Ergonomic Back Support Pillow for Car, Computer, Gaming Chair - Improve Posture While Sitting – Lu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616vrrF1JIL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"【Premium Rebounding Memory Foam】- With the high-density, thick, durable fabulous memory foam, the Lumbar Pillow fully shows its rebounding softness and firmly strong support. Tender and firm, This lumbar support pillow gives people soft and strong support with the right and healthy posture. 【Breathable Pillow Cover】- The pillow cover is made of breathable, hard-wearing polyester rayon, it is removable and washable for lasting use. The back support pillow can also keep air circulation well and always keep your back cool and comfortable, dry for the best experience. TWO adjustable buckled straps ensure the back pillow stays in place, and stop the lumbar pillow from sliding down, which can help us stay in the right and healthy sitting posture. 【Egonomic Design】- Our lumbar support pillow for office chairs has an ergonomic wrapped wing design that fits the natural curve and shape of your back for better support. The lumbar pillow embraces your back totally in a soft and firm way. The comfortable back support pillow will make your back relax and pain relief for a whole day while you are working in the office or traveling in a car, train or plane. 【Widely Applicable】- The size of the lumbar pillow is 15.1’’ x 15.2’’ x 3.9’’, which is portable and lightweight, you can carry it around just for comfortable sitting. The two straps make the backrest fits perfectly on any office chair, computer chair, armchair, sofa, couch, car, truck, wheelchair and recliner seat, etc. If you spend a long-time sitting like drivers, teachers, students, people in wheelchairs, office workers, elders, pregnant women, etc you will need such a comfortable back pillow. 【Improve Quality of Life as A Gift】- The back support pillow is designed ergonomically to relieve upper, mid, and lower back pain and back tightness, support you to achieve a healthy posture, and help maintain the natural curve of the spine. Back pain always troubles us, making us in poor condition, using this lumbar pillow would make our back pain relief. A lumbar back pillow is also a perfect gift for parents, office staff, drivers, students, and teachers who sit for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616vrrF1JIL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cuokiz","source_asin":"B09XFBWVGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XFBWVGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XFBWVGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
