window.products.push({"id":182349,"name":"Household Essentials Cube Book Shelf with Metal Mesh Wire Sides","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":143.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VMDGgU+-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your standard cube wall shelves with this attractive 4 cube storage organizer! This shelf unit offers multiple options for storage while adding to the attractiveness of your space. These shelves fit standard cube organizer bins, so you can use this organizer with drawers, but the cubes are attractive enough to use as shelves without bins. Use the shelves with bins to tuck items away and hide clutter for a neat and tidy space, or put items on display along with the shelves. This would make a great functional, decorative piece for any home, apartment, office or dorm. This unit has a trendy retro modern look with an industrial mix of metal and warm woodgrain laminate. The look and size of the unit would be perfect for a record player stand and record organizer as each cube is large enough to fit standard LP records, though there’s no limit to how you can use and display this attractive cube storage organizer. The modern industrial design is a trendy yet classic look that mixes well with a variety of design elements and styles for numerous different functions. Use it as a bookshelf, an entertainment center, a room divider, a hall console, kitchen organization and more. This shelving unit is made of high quality engineered wood, so it’s light and durable, and comes ready to assemble for fast and easy setup. The legs of the unit are metal for added durability and a more attractive industrial appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VMDGgU+-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B0BFMPKBYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFMPKBYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFMPKBYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
