window.products.push({"id":182393,"name":"GMHome 40\" Electric Fireplace Wall Mounted Freestanding Heater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WOSZ4T-QL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Choose GMHome Fireplace, Enjoy the Warmth and Ambiance This fireplace is designed for both wall mounted and free standing, you buy one fireplace and get two options. The simple design creates tidy & modern look to your décor. The flame effect can be used with or without heating, so you can enjoy the ambiance all year around. ONE fireplace, TWO options: Both wall mounting bracket & Freestanding feet included, so it can be wall mounted &simply use as a freestanding unit. The vent is on the top of the fireplace, not front, so can not be wall recessed. Up to 9 Color Options: Realistic crystal stone flame effect with up to 9 changeable flame color (yellow, green, blue, white, yellow & green, yellow & blue, yellow & white, green & blue, green & white) Color Cycling and Off. Adjustable flame brightness-5 setting High Efficient Heating: Dual heat settings available: 750W/1500W, enough for room up to 400ft². Make your room warm and toasty in freezing cold weather, and provide appropriate warmth without being too hot for slightly cold weather. All Year-around Use: Flame effect can be operated with or without heat, winter for heating and other seasons for decorating. Remote Control & Manual Panel Control: Manual Panel Control & Remote BOTH Available, including: on/off, heater , color changed control, temperature control Specification: Model: ZCR – 4013 Color: Black  Voltage: AC 120V   Frequency: 60Hz  Watts:750W/1500W   Temperature: 62°F to 82°F Timer setting: 1H to 8H Flame color: 9 options Remote Control Functions: ON/OFF  Heater  Timer  Temperature  Flame color Installation Remind: The wall mounting bracket is fixed on the back of the unit, and the freestanding feet are fixed on the left & right side of the unit. You just need to undo the screws and take down the bracket before Installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WOSZ4T-QL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMHome","source_asin":"B07644TPG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07644TPG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07644TPG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
