window.products.push({"id":182445,"name":"WILLOW WEAVE Firewood Rack Fire Log Holder Storage Set with 4 Tools Brush, Shovel, Poker, and Tongs, Easy to Use and Clean, Decorative Fireplace Wood ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eHiXZiBSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PATENTED!!! MEASUREMENTS：15.75\" W x 11.5\" D x 27.5\" H, the firewood rack is compact, aesthetically pleasing and very sturdy. The fireplace tools set is reasonably sized for a formal living area and holds enough wood (5-6 bundles of wood) to make an evening of casual burning much less time consuming. The fireplace stand set is with thick powder coatings, chip resistant and the metal is a respectable gauge, the welds are solid beads, strong enough to hold the weight of the wood. Max weight loading is 180 lbs. TOOLS INCLUDED: Fireplace tools are secured on each side of the bin holder, well made of wrought iron metal, solid and ergonomic, have a nice weight. You can expect many years use out of the rack and tools. The four tools are a plus as with logs and sticks coming into the house there are always messes to clean up and bigger logs to push into the stove opening. VENTILATION & SOLID SHELF: The firewood rack bin stands 2\" from the ground, to keep ventilation and isolate dampness, dry wood for easy burning. The bottom shelf is solid, which prevents the wood shred and debris falling down through the shelf, keeps the hearth clean. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Assembly is as easy as installing eight screws and nuts. Log rack will be together in less than 5 minutes, and get put to work immediately. INDOOR / OUTDOOR WOOD RACK: The log holder is an attractive decor piece that compliments both metal wood stoves or any fireplace. The matte black hearth center matches most fireplace screens, is a fine addition to your living room. The wood rack is good for holding logs to burn immediately and long term storage purposes. Easy to pick up & use in different rooms/locations, this is the ideal firewood storage solution for patio or deck. It is extremely functional with a minimal footprint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eHiXZiBSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WILLOW WEAVE","source_asin":"B09JZMS3XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JZMS3XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JZMS3XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
