window.products.push({"id":182452,"name":"Segarty Tote Bags, 1 Pack Large White Burlap Jute Reusable Canvas Gift Favors Bag with Handles Blank Totes Bulk for Bridesmaid Wedding, Women Market G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uQnP4iqSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Canvas,Jute Sturdy and Durable Handles--- Made of unbleached burlap (Jute) Fabric, our tote bags are durable and reusable. With Reinforced Stitching, soft handle straps are tightly sewed to jute tote bags, heavy duty and comfortable. Natural reusable bags can protect our environment from plastic bags. (Note: machine wash is not suggested). Perfect Size for Daily Use --- You will receive 1 large white burlap bag. The tote is 15.4x12.2x5.9\"(L*H*W), Handles: 6.3inch(H). Our jute totes can hold a lot of items. Large enough to hold a full size book, bottles of water, candy and nuts. Perfect size for a quick run to the market, for fruits and veggies. Great size and design for for wet swimsuits, diapers, wet clothes. Adorable and Functional --- Perfect for guest decorative gift bags, wedding hotel welcome bags for bridesmaids, bachelorette beach bags for the trip, birthday party favor bags. Perfect for wedding giveaways. They are not only frequently used for gift bags or grocery shopping bags, but for DIY Art Crafts like print crocheting writing embroidery. Elegant-looking --- After putting a lot of goodies in, they can hold up beautifully, very classy. Also you can tie a bandanna on the handles for its perfect look or iron on the vinyl to the bag for personalized idea, designing bags for your special occasion. Coated Inside ---PE film lined interior are waterproof and dirt-resistant which means our bags are easy to clean. With laminated lining, our tote bags can always keep in good shape. Widened bottom and sides enable our tote bags hold more while keep in original beautiful shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uQnP4iqSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Segarty","source_asin":"B09WQNQF3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WQNQF3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WQNQF3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
