window.products.push({"id":182478,"name":"Shinnwa Bar Stool Covers Round Seat Cushions with Elastic Waterproof Leather Cover and Non Slip Bottom for Barstool Foam Padded Cushion 12 Inch Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619EA6QCV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-Density Foam Padding 】Made of high-density foam, the bar stool seat cushions round 12\" are supportive and comfy even on the hardest stools. 【Waterproof Cover】The round barstool cushions has a waterproof cover, which is made of faux leather. Wipe the stains with tissues or cleaning cloths for easy cleaning. 【Gripper Backing & Elastic Strap】 Non-slip backing and elastic strap keep the cushions for round bar stools top in place on any round stool and fits snugly. 【Fit Most Stools】Approx 12 inch diameter and 1.3 inch thick padding, best for 11-12 inches wooden or metal stools. 【Specializing in Home Textiles】Shinnwa always provides quality products. These round stool cushions are of excellent quality and appearance, providing you with a comfortable experience, and they are also great decorations for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619EA6QCV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shinnwa","source_asin":"B07X4VRQVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X4VRQVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X4VRQVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":182479,"name":"Tumblers with Lids (4 pack) 16oz Pastel Colored Acrylic Cups with Lids and Straws | Double Wall Matte Plastic Bulk Tumblers With FREE Straw Cleaner! V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PR3J33LjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅4 FUN PURPLE CUPS TO SHARE: When you’ve got a personality this vibrant, you need a sassy, colorful tumbler to match. Show off your free-wheeling spirit and playful vibes with the CUTEST acrylic tumblers on Amazon. Each set includes four tumblers with lids and straws, so there are plenty to share with your fun-loving friends. Available in 16 oz. and 22 oz. sizes in your favorite to-go coffee cup ✅HOURS OF TEMPERATURE CONTROL: Our premium plastic tumblers come with insulated double walls, meaning your drink stays at the same temperature HOURS after pouring. Keep water, lemonade and juice frosty-cold, while hot drinks like coffee, tea and hot cocoa will stay warm and toasty. With thick acrylic walls and vacuum-sealed insulation, you’ll never have to deal with annoying drink “sweat” or water rings ruining your surfaces, either! ✅SPLASH-PROOF AND EASY TO CLEAN: Our handy travel cup set is the most fun way to stay hydrated during hardcore gym sessions, make long days at the office a tad more bearable, or cool down at the beach with a refreshing smoothie or iced drink. These lightweight tumblers are breeze to quickly hand wash, and we’ve even tossed in a handy wire brush to easily clean out the inside of the reusable straws, too. ✅MATTE FINISH IS SILKY SMOOTH: Told everyone in the office you were quitting those sodas, iced coffees, and boba drinks, but don’t want prying co-workers to see you already had a sugar relapse? Our tumblers come in a conveniently opaque matte finish, which both conceals the contents and is comfy to hold as you enjoy your guilty pleasure... Bring it to the gym tomorrow, but in the meantime, no one will be able to tell what you’re drinking when you cave on cheat days. (We won’t tell if you won’t.) ✅PERFECT FOR CUSTOM CREATIONS: Break out the die-cutting machine and get crafty, because these bulk tumblers make the perfect canvas for monogramming. We’ve left obnoxious logos and brand names off each tumbler cup, so they’re beautiful blank slates just waiting to be personalized. Surprise your girlfriends with fabulous girls weekend gifts, include in bachelorette party and bridal shower gift bags, or decorate one for everyone in the family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PR3J33LjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STRATA CUPS","source_asin":"B0BNPCTGNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNPCTGNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNPCTGNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
