window.products.push({"id":182521,"name":"Clean+Green Natural Stain Remover and Odor Eliminator - Carpet Cleaner, Pet Supplies, Household Cleaning Products for Cat Litter & Housebreaking, Carp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U4WAtrcNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR HOME CLEAN: Our upholstery cleaner effectively eliminates difficult deep stains and stubborn odors left behind by your pets. Clean and remove odors associated with urine, pet markings, pet spray, pet food stains or vomit. The spray nozzle works smoothly, even upside-down! POWERFUL FORMULA: Our couch cleaner uses a patented encapsulation technology to help permanently eliminate difficult stains and odors. It's great for home and commercial use in veterinary offices, shelters, doggy daycares or other high use areas. Our odor eliminator for strong odor is the perfect solution for a fresh home. GENTLE FORMULA: Our formula is safe for pets and kids yet still counteracts even stubborn pet urine odors. Our rug cleaner is fragrance-free, unscented, and non-flammable. Our dye-free and bleach-free formula is tested and approved for use on carpets, furniture, fabrics, hard surfaces and more! ESSENTIAL ACTIVE INGREDIENTS: Our pet odor eliminator for home is made with naturally-derived and plant-based ingredients. Our products are well-balanced and certified cruelty free products. We make a carpet cleaner for pets you can feel good about. PREMIUM QUALITY: All of our products are made in the USA in GMP-compliant facilities with the finest ingredients available. Clean+Green is a minority-owned business that has a mission to create effective products for busy parents and pet owners.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U4WAtrcNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clean+Green","source_asin":"B07173PFQ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07173PFQ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07173PFQ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":182522,"name":"Zulay Double Whisk Milk Frother Handheld Mixer - High Powered Frother For Coffee With Improved Motor - Electric Whisk Drink Mixer For Cappuccino, Frap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pUhy8C8GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE RICH, CREAMY FROTH IN SECONDS: We coffee lovers are serious when it comes to our coffee. The Milk Boss Frother gives that professional finishing touch to your latte, cappuccino, macchiato or hot chocolate. Make delicious foamy creamer for your drinks at home without any trip to a coffee shop with your own milk frother. The benefits of having your own electric drink whisk mixer are endless, you can make your own best latte, you know your tastes best. MATCHA WHISKING, COFFEE & MORE: Works better than a manual matcha whisk for making matcha tea and works far better than fork or whisk for coffee. It works very well to mix nutritious protein powder drinks with no extra container, blender or bottle shaker to wash. Use our mini mixer for your whisking and mixing needs: Give healthy shakes and smoothies a kick by adding powder or egg nog flavor and mixing. PROVEN & TRUSTED QUALITY: We use only premium materials. Our Double whisk milk frother will not rust or break, ever. Built to last. Our small and efficient frother works on all types of milk - half and half, creamer, soy, almond, cashew, hazelnut, whole milk, and other dairy such as butter or cream. EASY TO CLEAN & STORE: The durable, convenient metal stand gives easy access for foamy goodness in seconds. Cleanup for this matcha wisk & frother is even faster. To clean just put the whisk in hot running water and briefly turn it on – instantly clean! When stored on counter or table it sits nicely next other coffee accessories. Our powerful and durable hand-held milk frother is powered by two AA batteries (not included) with a compact electric design that easily fits in a drawer. NO HASSLE, ZULAY GURANTEE: We love and take pride in our milk frother and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. Have the confidence that this frother will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not make your foam exactly how you want it, we got you covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pUhy8C8GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BT8BNNZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT8BNNZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT8BNNZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
