window.products.push({"id":182536,"name":"ReUsies 2 Pack Snack and Sandwich Reusable Bags, Space Cadet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81foRgkbCvL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The EPA estimates 500 billion to 100 trillion plastic bags are used worldwide every year. A typical school/work lunch contains 3-4 plastic sandwich bags each day amounting to upwards of 1,000 each year for one person. These bags will all be around long after we are gone! ReUsies are a reusable alternative that will keep these baggies out of our landfills. ReUsies come in two convenient sizes, snack and sandwich. The smaller, snack sized bag is 6\"x 5\" and holds a half sandwich or whole sandwich with the crusts cut off. It is good for smaller quantities of crackers, pretzels, and apple slices. The larger, sandwich sized bag is 7.5\"x 6\" and holds a typical \"grown up\" sized sandwich, full bagel, or larger quantity of snacks. ReUsies are 100% cotton on the outside, lined with leak resistant nylon, and seal with Velcro closures with lead, BPA, and phthalate free. ReUsies are water resistant so can hold everything from orange slices to peanut butter sandwiches with no leaks. ReUsies are simple to clean; they can be wiped out with a soapy sponge, thrown in the washer/dryer or even run through the dishwasher. In addition to being great for packing snacks, ReUsies have other uses as well. They make great cosmetic bags and hold pacifiers, small toys, cell phone chargers, iPods, virtually anything you would have used a plastic baggie for in the past. Buy a few today and go waste-free for lunch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81foRgkbCvL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ReUsies","source_asin":"B0055XJ3SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0055XJ3SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0055XJ3SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
