window.products.push({"id":182616,"name":"Hyde Lane 400 Thread Count 100% Cotton Queen Size Sheet Set, Organic Cotton Sateen Sheets with Deep Pockets Fits Mattress Up to 14\" Deep, Ultra Soft T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S6HS2+YtL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Cotton SUPERIOR SOFTNESS–SILKY STREAMS OF COTTON MADE FOR YOUR SKIN: Our 100% Cotton featuring a rich, buttery-smooth weave, so these sheets feature a luxurious 400TC and a slightly luminous finish. Only the best cotton makes it into our sheets, The long staple cotton sateen weave sheets are sweat wicking and temperature balancing to keep you cool during summer and warm during winters. Like your favorite hotel's sheets, we use a classic sateen weave because it provides a softer, more supple feel. SHEET SET FOR ALL MATTRESS SIZES: Includes – 1 Fitted 60” x 80” + 14”, 1 Flat 90” x 102” and 2 Shams 20” x 31”, our included fitted sheet will to cover most mattress depth. So there's a stretchable elastic around the extra deep fitted sheet which stretches for a nice tug around your mattress. Easily fit the extra tall & large mattresses. Corners DON’T RIDE UP - creating a smooth, wrinkle free bedding that beckons you to relax on it, every night. PREMIUM COTTON THREADING: MOST PEOPLE DON’T KNOW the intricate weaving process that produces the most sought after, premium cotton on the planet... WE KNOW though! The entire manufacturing process — not just the growing of the cotton — follows strict standards. Hyde Lane has nurtured relationships with the ‘gurus’ of the cotton industry, meaning we source the most authentic 100% cotton known to man, and you can FEEL THE DIFFERENCE. PILLING PROOF – SHRINK PROOF – COLOR PROOF: MOST COMPETITORS SACRIFICE QUALITY BY producing synthesized cotton in a ‘not up to code’ chemically controlled plant… NOT US! At Hyde Lane we have our manufacturers produce through green, efficient means that ensure QUALITY THAT NEVER FADES even after thousands of washes and dries.The fabric is light and airy for those who prefer breathable and cool, and it's crisp for those who prefer a relaxed look and feel. BUILT TO LAST: SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – WE KNOW YOU’RE TIRED OF buying inferior sheets that pill, shrink and fade after only the first few uses. That’s why we engineered our cotton fitted sheets to last as long as possible with REINFORCED STITCHES and ROBUST SEAMS that ensure longevity","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S6HS2+YtL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyde Lane","source_asin":"B07TLQ5NB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TLQ5NB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TLQ5NB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
