window.products.push({"id":182646,"name":"Tension Shower Curtain Rod Spring Rods for Bathroom Windows Closet Shelf 60-102 Inch No Drill Adjustable Extension Anti-slip Rubber Base Never Rust Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EhuyLEB6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏆Stretch or contract as you like🏆 Adjustable length: 60.02\"-102.35\" (155cm-260cm). No drilling, no screws, or any other tools, by rotating the tension shower curtain rod, you can quickly and easily install the tension rod to expand or contract, meets your needs for installation in different positions. It can be used as a curtain rod in the living room and room, as well as a shower curtain rod, and can be used as a layered treatment for the wardrobe to make good use of space. 🏆Exquisite appearance, terrific connotation🏆 Made of high-quality 304 stainless steel, φ32mm, 1.5mm thickness, 3000rmp polishing process, which greatly extends the service life of this chrome color shower rod (Mirror stainless steel rod is more resistant to corrosion than brushed nickel shower curtain rod and will never rust). Maximum capacity: 25kg. Inner lock design, built-in thickened spring, and booster connection sleeve, it will not loose easily after adjusting the tension rod. 🏆Thickened fixed base + spider web pattern🏆 The Thickened EBS non-slip rubber base, provides you with super stable performance and can ensure that your wall will not be scratched. The spider web pattern design increases the adhesion between the rod and the base, sticking to the wall like spiderman, providing you with reliable protection. 🏆Multi-role for multi-purpose🏆 No matter it is a cloth curtain rod installed in the living room or a shower stall curtain rod in the bathroom, there is no need to worry about rusting. It is suitable for different smooth surfaces such as brick walls, concrete walls, wallpaper, wooden walls, etc. 🏆Easy assemble + Excellent Service.🏆 Package included: 1X shower curtain rod. You can easily install or remove this curtain tension rod within 5 minutes (please make sure it is 90° perpendicular to the wall when installing). Convenient and reusable, you can reinstall wherever you move. Excellent quality can save you the expense of repurchasing in the future. Authentic and backed by a trusted 30-day return policy and lifetime warranty to ensure your total satisfaction and peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EhuyLEB6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WASAIT","source_asin":"B08K877B6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K877B6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K877B6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
