window.products.push({"id":182667,"name":"Alarm Clock for Kids,Teens,Bedroom - 7 Color Night Light,7.5\" Big Green Display & 0-100% Fully Dimmable,2 USB Charger,12/24H,Battery Backup,Simple Dig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6137U-njoVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Attractive Soothing 𝗡𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁 𝗟𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁 𝗔𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 with 7 Colored Options】Simply tap the large NIGHT LIGHT button to switch 7 colors in turn,perfectly as children's all night companion for bedroom nightstand night light without turning on lamp.while,the option to turn off night light is useful for someone who prefers total darkness. 【7.5” 𝗟𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗲 𝗡𝘂𝗺𝗯𝗲𝗿 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 & 0-100% Full Range Brightness Dimmer】Highly visible time readout on the display you can view from far distance without putting your glasses on.especially for the elders and kids,and also for those with vision issues to overcome blurry eyes. Allow you to set the brightness to your comfortable level - all the way from exceedingly bright to exceedingly dim.and sleep without disturbing glare,simply push the dimmer slider to adjust the brightness you prefer. 【 Outlet Powered 𝗣𝗹𝘂𝗴-𝗶𝗻 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 /𝗕𝗮𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗿𝘆 𝗕𝗮𝗰𝗸𝘂𝗽 𝗦𝗲𝘁𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴𝘀】Package includes AC adapter to power on the clock,2 * AAA battery is required to memorize time and alarm setting in case of power failure,also it is able to triger an alarm even power outages even display goes black without worrying getting up late. 【𝗗𝘂𝗮𝗹 𝗨𝗦𝗕 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗖𝗲𝗹𝗹𝗽𝗵𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗶𝗻𝗴】This 𝗻𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 allows two devices cellphone or tablet pc to be charged at same time.simple connected with usb port before you go to bed,it will be fully charged when you wake up in the morning. 【Raised ALARM PAUSE button & Bigger SNOOZE button than average】buttons are simple and intuitive for setup without annoying hold or repeat press.Simply press the sticked up ALARM PAUSE button to turn off alarm by feel without opening eyes in the morning. bigger snooze button than average with light facility is added bonus,to get extra 9 minutes sleep you can pause alarm very quickly by pressing SNOOZE button without opening eyes in the morning. 【Adjustable 𝗟𝗼𝘂𝗱 𝗔𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗛𝗲𝗮𝘃𝘆 𝗦𝗹𝗲𝗲𝗽𝗲𝗿𝘀】wake up the heavey sleepers with loudest alarm volume equal to 80 DB.buzzer sound is soothing instead of obnoxious harsing sounds.alarm starts slower and softer and then increases gradually until it reaches its maximum so you can wake up more gently. 【𝗗𝘂𝗮𝗹 𝗨𝗦𝗕 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗖𝗲𝗹𝗹𝗽𝗵𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗶𝗻𝗴】This 𝗻𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 allows two devices cellphone or tablet pc to be charged at same time.simple connected with usb port before you go to bed,it will be fully charged when you wake up in the morning. 【12H & 24H Time Format & Warranty Service】 this clock is designed with a slider to switch 12H or 24H time format.as some of Americans complained average Clock only has 12 Hour format and can not ignore some of them are used to 24 Hour Time Format. 𝗢𝗻𝗲-𝗬𝗲𝗮𝗿 𝗪𝗮𝗿𝗿𝗮𝗻𝘁𝘆,𝟯𝟬-𝗗𝗮𝘆 𝗠𝗼𝗻𝗲𝘆 𝗕𝗮𝗰𝗸, 𝟮𝟰 𝗛𝗼𝘂𝗿𝘀 𝗖𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗲𝗿 𝗦𝗲𝗿𝘃𝗶𝗰𝗲 𝗥𝗲𝘀𝗽𝗼𝗻𝘀𝗲 by contacting us seller’ support email support@mesqool.com","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6137U-njoVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mesqool","source_asin":"B095PMF58H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095PMF58H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095PMF58H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
