window.products.push({"id":182671,"name":"SANA Multi Use Masticating Slow Juicer & Cold Press Oil Extractor Supreme Set | Patented DC Motor | 4 Speeds, Food Grade Premium Accessories & Custom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":899.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TKWRSmP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SANA SUPREME JUICING SYSTEM - Delivers the highest yield compared to other juicers, the heavy-duty auger grinds and presses your produce to squeeze out as much juice as possible making juicing faster. This cold press juicing system offers 3 juicing screens. The fine juicing screen gives the highest juice yield. The coarse juicing screen has less pressure, allowing for softer fruits to be juiced and the homogenizing screen allows you to make all-natural nut butters and milks, along with sorbets, MAX FLAVOR & NUTRIENTS - Guarantees higher nutritional content using masticating technology. Ideal for juicing herbs and all kinds of fibrous fruits and veggies like watermelon, orange, celery, cucumber, apple, carrot, beets, ginger & more. A variety of nuts and seeds can be pressed with the Oil Extractor such as flax, sesame, sunflower, pumpkin, rapeseed, hemp, poppy, evening primrose & black cumin. Chopped nuts can also be processed including almonds, pine nuts, walnuts, hazelnuts, peanuts, ca PATENTED MOTOR WITH 4 SPEEDS - Developed with an advanced brushless DC motor that allows for non stop operation and a unique auto-reverse feature. Additional benefits include a lightweight durable design, longer operating time, lower power consumption, and ultra quiet operation. With 4 variable speed options that range from 40, 65, 90 or 120 RPM. Lower speeds allow for gentle precise juicing, minimizing foam and oxidation, especially good for soft or fibrous produce. Higher speeds are great for 24/7 FRESH & HEALTHY COLD PRESSED OIL - The SANA Single Screw Cold Press extractor allows you to make just as much oil as you need for personal use, flavorings, culinary uses, or natural remedies. Oils have a tendency to go bad over time or when improperly stored. This results in a loss of flavor and nutrients. Because this extractor uses a cold-pressing system, the nutrients and taste are far beyond anything you can buy in store. With its solid food-grade stainless steel construction our oil ex PREMIUM SERVICE & ACCESSORIES - Along with our outstanding 15 Year Manufacturer Warranty we also ensure the full package is delivered in one box. Included with the SANA 727 Supreme juicer & 702 Oil Press is a custom recipe book, 1x Handmade 500ml Bohemian Crystal Glass, 1x Custom-Designed food-grade SS angled Pulp Catcher, 1x Glass Oil Pitcher, 1x SS Strainer and a Protective Glove. A bullet proof package for creating home made juices and oils simply and efficiently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TKWRSmP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sana","source_asin":"B09LJ2S8R4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LJ2S8R4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LJ2S8R4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
