window.products.push({"id":182696,"name":"Shine Decor LED ECO Strip Light 2800K Warm White, Cold Resistant Waterproof 331 Lmn/M Bright Rope Light, AC120V End-to-end Connectable Lighting Strips","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71exLbqhv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡SUPER BRIGHT -> Premium 60LEDs/M SMD 2835 are adopted for this AC110-120V led strip lighting. The LED strip light shines bright and uniform lighting with 331 lumens per meter. An ideal lighting choice for living room or commercial buildings. ❤️CUTTABLE & CONNECTABLE -> The high volt led strip light's cross section is 7.5mm (height) x 11.5mm (width). It is cuttable and flexible for DIY projects. There are cutting marks at every *0.5m/1.64ft*. With its male-to-female connectors, it’s easy to connect 2 or more strips together, extending the total length. Pls note that the max. connectable length is *40meters/131feet*. ❤️SPLASHPROOF -> The extendable strip light is protected by IP65 waterproof thick PVC shell, hence suitable for both inside and outside home or commercial locations, such as roof, garden, lawn, balcony, deck, living or bed room, porch etc. *WARM TIP> - only the LED chips covered by PVC shell is definitely waterproof. So it is important to waterproof all the joints and ends by sealing them with silicone glue and adding a waterproof box to avoid water seeping in. ❤️COLDNESS RESISTANT -> The bright white led strip lighting is resistant to low temperature from -4℉ to 122℉ (-20℃ to 50 ℃). Perfect Lighting for even high-latitude areas or anywhere that often go through snow days. ❤️SAFE TO USE -> This ETL Listed LED strip light ensures a longer lifespan and safety for use. All the accessories, power cord and the instruction are included for quick installation. If additional power cords needed, pls search ASIN: B0BLHD9D2Y on Amazon for purchase. ❤️DIMMABLE -> Different brightness create different tones. Choose a compatible dimmer, then you can change the brightness no matter when reading, working, playing or so. The criteria for a dimmer are: (1) its rated power should be larger than the power of strip lights (3.88W/M) divided by 0.8. (2) its volt should be AC110V-120. (3) always retain the original rectifier. ❤️QUICK SUPPORT -> If any further concerns, pls feel free to contact us through Amazon message. Shine Decor always reply within 24 hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71exLbqhv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shine Decor","source_asin":"B0BQ6JMQ4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ6JMQ4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ6JMQ4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
