window.products.push({"id":182760,"name":"BlindsAvenue Cellular Honeycomb Cordless Shade, 9/16\" Single Cell, Light Filtering, White, Size: 33.5\" W x 48\" H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.56,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCdvCW6ZS._AC_SL1321_.jpg","description":"HOW TO ORDER: Each cellular shade is produced at exact size as your order. For inside mount, it is important you order the shade width 1/4\" ? 3/8? smaller than the actual window width. Please refer to the inside mount photo size chart between actual window width vs Shade Width to order. For outside mount, you can order the size you want, we recommend ordering additional width to prevent light gaps on the sides of your window. Please refer to how to measure and how to order illustrations. BlindsAvenue Cellular shades are made of spun lace, non-woven fabric. 100% polyester. They are single cell light filtering fabrics that provide privacy but also let the light in. The spun lace fabric is durable and soft to the touch, not like others that have a paper feel. These are high quality shades and are economical. BlindsAvenue cellular shades feature an upgraded cordless operation making them perfect for child and pet safety. The cordless operation also allows you to not have to order the exact length of your window. Our cellular shades with cordless operation allow the shade to stop at any length up to 72\" tall. For windows less than 48\" tall order the 48\" height. For windows between 48\" tall and 72\" tall order the 72\" length, you just simply lower the shade to the desired length. BlindsAvenue Cellular shades reduce harmful effects of ultraviolet rays; provide ideal insulation for energy efficiency saving you money all year on your energy bills. Stay cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter. You will be surprised at how great our cellular shades help control your desired room temperature. BlindsAvenue Cellular shades are made and shipped FAST! Your shades should arrive between 7-10 Days from your order date depending on where you are located in the US. If you need your shades faster you can order express shipping at checkout.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCdvCW6ZS._AC_SL1321_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlindsAvenue","source_asin":"B078WFM9RP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078WFM9RP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078WFM9RP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
