window.products.push({"id":182914,"name":"Container Furniture Direct Michael Modern Faux Leather Upholstered Stainless Steel Legs Living Room, Sofa, Black Camel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":619.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J+v1pAO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring stately elegance to your living space with the Michael Segura living room sofa. Upholstered sofa measures 92.61\" L x 34\" W x 34.7\" H and weighs 92.60 Lbs. This listing comes with a sofa only. The items require minor assembly upon delivery.  This piece was designed to be comfortable, stylish, sturdy and built to last for years to come. Features top grade bonded leather upholstery for a smooth and easy to clean surface, pillow top armrests for additional comfort and finally accented with stainless steel sofa legs to complete the look. This collection will be the smart choice for the modern contemporary living room. Container Furniture Direct has been supplying customers with originally designed furniture that is modern, sturdy and comfortable all rolled into one so you don't have to compromise looks for comfortability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J+v1pAO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Container Furniture Direct","source_asin":"B0C1SZNSCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1SZNSCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1SZNSCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":182915,"name":"Simply Calphalon Stainless 12-Inch Omelet Pan with Nonstick Interior","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EVMEEBVRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com The Simply Calphalon Stainless line of cookware is an excellent alternative for those who prefer the look of stainless steel and the easy maintenance of cooking on nonstick. This cookware also is a great fit for those who desire Calphalon quality at a more budget price. Perfect for larger portions, this 12-inch omelet pan cooks a large six-egg omelet or a family-sized frittata. Its low, sloping sides also make it useful for shallow frying of crab cakes or for searing chicken breasts. Made of attractive 18/10 brushed stainless steel, the pan has an aluminum core through the bottom for even heat distribution. Its double-coated nonstick interior prevents food from sticking and makes cleanup easier. The stainless-steel loop handle is comfortable to grip, plus it minimizes heat transfer so the handle stays cool on the stovetop. This cookware is oven-safe up to 450 degrees F so you dont have to dirty several pans to make one dish. All cookware in this line is 100-percent dishwasher-safe and is covered by a 10-year warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde From the Manufacturer Simply Calphalon makes choosing cookware a simple proposition. Everything that counts in cookware--delicious results, good looks, easy clean up, durability--is built right into it. Best of all, Simply Calphalon makes it easy to enjoy the simple pleasures of preparing and sharing great food at home. So what are you waiting for? Go home and cook! All-around solid construction and performance.Youll feel the difference--and the quality--the moment you pick up a Simply Calphalon pan. Simply Calphalon cookware is heavier than similarly priced cookware. That extra weight not only means greater durability; it also means improved performance. Inside every Simply Calphalon Stainless pan is a bottom core crafted from heavy-gauge, highly conductive aluminum. This uniformly thick core is critical to Simply Calphalons performance. It conducts heat evenly and efficiently--so foods cook evenly, too. Interior and exterior surfaces of Simply Calphalon Stainless are made from surgical quality 18/10 stainless steel. Theyre subtly brushed, to maintain their good looks through the years. And theyre non-reactive; so they wont change color or affect the taste of your food. Plus, most Simply Calphalon pans are oven and broiler safe, opening all kinds of options for creative cooking. Nonstick omelette pans and covers are oven-safe to 450 degrees. Sleek--and smart--styling Clean lines, sleek silhouettes and simple elegance are the essence of Calphalon style. Wheter your décor is traditional, retro or eclectic, the classic Calphalon look simply works! But at Calphalon, form alsways follows function. We design our pans to be hard-working as well as good-looking. Simply Calphalons contoured stainless steel long handles are individually sized for perfect balance and easy maneuverability with each pan. Helper handles on larger pans provide an extra measure of comfort and safety. All handles are double-riveted to stay right and tight fo rthe life of your cookware. Domed, tempered glass covers collect and return moisture to foods while they cook. And they make it easy to see houw your meal is progressing, too. Easy soap-and-water clean-up. Cooking doesnt have to be a lot of work. And with Simply Calphalon Stainless, neither does clean-up. Pans clean up easily with soap and water. In a hurry? You can even put them in the dishwasher. Simply Calphalon is protected by a ten-year warranty. Every inch and every aspect of Simply Calphalon is designed and tested to meet Calphalons strict quality standards. Simply Calphalon pans, handles, nonstick performance, and covers are covered by our 10-Year Warranty. Calphalon will repair or replace any item found defective in material or workmanship when put to normal household use and cared for according to instructions. Its as simple as that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EVMEEBVRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00008PC4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-182915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008PC4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008PC4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
